éficier du statut fiscal LMNP amortissable, offrant une exonération d'impôt sur vos revenus locatifs.\n3. ContactPour toute information complémentaire, veuillez contacter Acumen Patrimoine :\nTéléphone : 01 41 55 12 20\n\nEmail : info@acumenpatrimoine.fr","addr":"90 Allée De Madrid","gal":["https://dj32ymiemc11o.cloudfront.net/eyJidWNrZXQiOiJvdGFyZWUtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi1maWxlcyIsImtleSI6IjQwMjJmNTAxNTdkMzFiYWU1NjU1ZGU3OTI5ZDA2NDFlMWVmOGQ0NzciLCJlZGl0cyI6eyJyZXNpemUiOnsid2lkdGgiOjkwMCwiaGVpZ2h0Ijo5MDAsImZpdCI6Imluc2lkZSJ9fSwiZmlsZUhhc2giOiJkNmJhMmUzODE2MWFlNTM0YzY3OTNmOTkzNjk4NjdkNSJ9?signature=78aa482afa330bbf42a9b20bb2280f640a9218ea5a938645d3642b14f805b473","https://dj32ymiemc11o.cloudfront.net/eyJidWNrZXQiOiJvdGFyZWUtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi1maWxlcyIsImtleSI6ImIzMDk3M2Q3YWM1YjY0YzRmMzdkMWM5ZjVjOGNmNTg1YTEwMWYyMDIiLCJlZGl0cyI6eyJyZXNpemUiOnsid2lkdGgiOjkwMCwiaGVpZ2h0Ijo5MDAsImZpdCI6Imluc2lkZSJ9fSwiZmlsZUhhc2giOiJkNzQ4NjM0MDYyZWY5OWU4ZGVlZmRhNjU4MjgwMmU5YyJ9?signature=df5119bb0304d1f0dbeb9c3a2be624af64602cb0a69276613f284c794235850a","https://dj32ymiemc11o.cloudfront.net/eyJidWNrZXQiOiJvdGFyZWUtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi1maWxlcyIsImtleSI6IjkxZDNiOGNjZGYxOGU0ZWFiZmQ3MDlmMmU0OWY1ODFmODhmYThlOGQiLCJlZGl0cyI6eyJyZXNpemUiOnsid2lkdGgiOjkwMCwiaGVpZ2h0Ijo5MDAsImZpdCI6Imluc2lkZSJ9fSwiZmlsZUhhc2giOiJiOWQyZmQ3MWM5NzMyYjJkNGQxMzRhMTg0MDcxZTA2ZSJ9?signature=ae046cdea77708af6ed9acf887f2d3bad33c96d31591b1c80315e568b7adacc1","https://dj32ymiemc11o.cloudfront.net/eyJidWNrZXQiOiJvdGFyZWUtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi1maWxlcyIsImtleSI6ImIyNzJjNGJiMDY3ZjkxZGRiYWMzMjZlMjcxY2FjN2VjMmM2YzI3MTAiLCJlZGl0cyI6eyJyZXNpemUiOnsid2lkdGgiOjkwMCwiaGVpZ2h0Ijo5MDAsImZpdCI6Imluc2lkZSJ9fSwiZmlsZUhhc2giOiI2OGMyYzJmOWUzMzdlMmNkNmRlOGViNzAwYjY0YmQxZSJ9?signature=858bd62bafb266d59cd70eb4334e57e939430d99b4d542c1fcd02986787241d7","https://dj32ymiemc11o.cloudfront.net/eyJidWNrZXQiOiJvdGFyZWUtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi1maWxlcyIsImtleSI6IjllZWJmMDA2Y2Q3Mjc4YzkwMTQ4MzZhYjQ2YzU1OWUwNmFkNTI5OTIiLCJlZGl0cyI6eyJyZXNpemUiOnsid2lkdGgiOjkwMCwiaGVpZ2h0Ijo5MDAsImZpdCI6Imluc2l